<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Parker Metheny | What you can count on</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,500;9..144,700;9..144,800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f3f4f7;--surface:#fff;--ink:#14203a;--muted:#59627a;--line:#d8dce5;--accent:#9e1b32;--accent-ink:#fff;--soft:#ece9ee;
--serif:'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;--sans:'Instrument Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;
box-sizing:border-box;padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#0f1320;--surface:#171c2b;--ink:#eaedf4;--muted:#9ba4ba;--line:#293046;--accent:#e4596f;--accent-ink:#0f1320;--soft:#1f2538}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#0f1320;--surface:#171c2b;--ink:#eaedf4;--muted:#9ba4ba;--line:#293046;--accent:#e4596f;--accent-ink:#0f1320;--soft:#1f2538}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 1.0625rem/1.6 var(--sans)}
a{color:var(--accent)}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.wrap{max-width:58rem;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem}
.hero{display:flex;gap:3rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:4.5rem 0 4rem}
.hero .text{min-width:0}
.hero h1{font:800 clamp(2.6rem,8vw,5.2rem)/1.02 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 1.25rem}
.hero p{font:500 1.2rem/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);max-width:30rem;margin:0 0 1.75rem}
.hero img{width:15rem;height:15rem;flex:none;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 30%;border-radius:46% 54% 50% 50%/50% 46% 54% 50%;box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--accent)}
.btns{display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{padding:.7rem 1.3rem;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--accent)}
.btn.p{background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}
.btn.g{color:var(--accent)}
h2{font:700 clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.4rem)/1.15 var(--serif);margin:0 0 .5rem;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 2rem;max-width:36rem}
section{padding:3.5rem 0}
.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:13rem 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:start}
[role=tablist]{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem}
[role=tab]{font:600 1.25rem/1.2 var(--serif);text-align:left;background:none;border:0;border-left:4px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);padding:.8rem 1rem;cursor:pointer}
[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{color:var(--ink);border-left-color:var(--accent);background:var(--surface)}
[role=tab]:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.panel{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:2rem}
.panel[hidden]{display:none}
.panel h3{font:800 clamp(2rem,5vw,3.2rem)/1.05 var(--serif);margin:0 0 .5rem;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.panel .claim{font:500 1.35rem/1.4 var(--serif);color:var(--accent);margin:0 0 1.5rem}
.proof{display:grid;gap:1rem}
.proof p{margin:0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;background:var(--soft);border-radius:8px}
.proof b{display:block;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.15rem}
.calc{margin-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:1.25rem}
.calc h4{margin:0 0 .75rem;font:600 1.05rem var(--sans)}
.calc label{display:grid;grid-template-columns:9rem 1fr 4.5rem;gap:.75rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.5rem;font-size:.95rem}
.calc input{width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent)}
.calc output{font-weight:600;text-align:right}
.result{margin-top:.75rem;font:700 1.5rem var(--serif)}
.result span{color:var(--accent)}
.skills{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(16rem,1fr));gap:1.25rem}
.skill{border-top:3px solid var(--accent);padding-top:.9rem}
.skill h3{font:700 1.3rem/1.25 var(--serif);margin:0 0 .4rem}
.skill p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
.path{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1.5rem 3rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:1.75rem 0}
.path div{flex:1 1 14rem}
.path strong{display:block;font:700 1.1rem var(--serif)}
.path span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
footer{padding:3.5rem 0 4rem}
footer h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,3.4rem)}
footer a.big{font:600 1.3rem var(--sans)}
@media (max-width:42rem){
.hero{flex-direction:column-reverse;align-items:flex-start;gap:2rem}.hero img{width:10.5rem;height:10.5rem;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--accent)}
.stage{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}[role=tablist]{flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem}
[role=tab]{border-left:0;border-bottom:3px solid var(--line);padding:.5rem .7rem;font-size:1.05rem}[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}
.panel{padding:1.4rem}.calc label{grid-template-columns:7rem 1fr 4rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="hero">
<div class="text">
<h1>Give me the job. I'll get it done right.</h1>
<p>I'm Parker Metheny, a finance and operations management student at the University of Alabama. Here is how I work, with proof.</p>
<div class="btns"><a class="btn p" href="mailto:parkermetheny2@gmail.com">Email me</a><a class="btn g" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/parker-metheny-bba5bb373" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div>
</div>
<img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Portrait of Parker Metheny in a navy suit and light blue tie" width="520" height="520">
