<section id="traits">
<h2>Five things you can count on</h2>
<p class="sub">Pick a trait to see what it looks like in real life.</p>
<div class="stage">
<div role="tablist" aria-label="Traits">
<button role="tab" id="t0" aria-controls="p0" aria-selected="true">Dependable</button>
<button role="tab" id="t1" aria-controls="p1" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Empathetic</button>
<button role="tab" id="t2" aria-controls="p2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Curious</button>
<button role="tab" id="t3" aria-controls="p3" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Analytical</button>
<button role="tab" id="t4" aria-controls="p4" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1">Passionate</button>
</div>
<div>
<div class="panel" id="p0" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t0"><h3>Dependable</h3><p class="claim">Hand it to me and stop worrying about it.</p>
<div class="proof"><p><b>At work</b>When my manager needed an emergency opener, I was the one who showed up.</p><p><b>At home</b>Every roommate had a list of things to buy for our apartment. I collected all of it, so we started the year fully set up.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="p1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t1" hidden><h3>Empathetic</h3><p class="claim">I listen first, then help.</p>
<div class="proof"><p><b>Being there</b>A friend was in a hard family situation I had been through myself. I listened, gave honest advice, and it ended in his favor.</p><p><b>Acting fast</b>A friend was stuck with a dead phone and no wallet. I paid for his ride home, and he got there safe.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="p2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t2" hidden><h3>Curious</h3><p class="claim">When something interests me, I keep digging.</p>
<div class="proof"><p><b>Watches</b>I study brands, styles, and complications, and my collection grows because I keep wanting to learn more.</p><p><b>Plate tectonics</b>I went deep on how they work, and now I help a friend through our GEO 101 class.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="p3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t3" hidden><h3>Analytical</h3><p class="claim">I run the numbers before I commit.</p>
<div class="proof"><p><b>Personal budget</b>I worked out a weekly spending limit from my summer earnings and checked what would be left over the year.</p><p><b>Fair splits</b>Before move-in, I built a list of apartment purchases with prices and necessity so no roommate paid a disproportionate share.</p></div>
<div class="calc"><h4>Try the math: how far does summer money go?</h4>
<label>Summer earnings<input type="range" id="e" min="1000" max="10000" step="100" value="6000"><output id="eo"></output></label>
<label>Spend per week<input type="range" id="s" min="25" max="300" step="5" value="100"><output id="so"></output></label>
<label>Weeks to cover<input type="range" id="w" min="10" max="52" step="1" value="30"><output id="wo"></output></label>
<div class="result" aria-live="polite">Left over: <span id="r"></span></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="p4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t4" hidden><h3>Passionate</h3><p class="claim">I care how it turns out.</p>
<div class="proof"><p><b>Going early</b>I arrived 10 minutes early to my summer job though I didn't have to. My manager noticed and gave me better sections and more tables.</p><p><b>Loyalty</b>I'm a lifelong committed Alabama fan, and that same commitment shows up in the work I take on.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
<h2>What I can do for you</h2>
<p class="sub">Skills from real work, written as what they let me do.</p>
<div class="skills">
<div class="skill"><h3>Keep clients moving</h3><p>Managed 200+ clients at an insurance office, with accurate data entry and fast turnaround that helped cut the processing backlog.</p></div>
<div class="skill"><h3>Work in Excel and client systems</h3><p>Grew from general customer service into client management systems and Excel-based work.</p></div>
<div class="skill"><h3>Stay steady under pressure</h3><p>Ran several tables at once during a busy beach-town summer and got consistent positive feedback from guests.</p></div>
<div class="skill"><h3>Track many things at once</h3><p>Handled scorekeeping, the game clock, and penalties across several lacrosse games at the same time.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section>
<div class="path">
<div><strong>University of Alabama</strong><span>B.S. Finance and Operations Management, 2025 to 2029, GPA 3.245</span></div>
<div><strong>Studying now</strong><span>Statistical Data Analysis, Marketing, Organizational Behavior, Business Communications</span></div>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
<h2>Let's talk.</h2>
